Other independent assumptions remain at base for every sensitivity run. They
include the FY2026 reported 20.3% effective tax rate, working-capital days based
on FY2026, depreciation/revenue of 1.61%, capex/revenue of 1.47%, 8.5% WACC,
2.5% terminal growth, and 1,481.0 million diluted shares. FCFF is free cash flow
to the firm, calculated as NOPAT + depreciation − capex − change in net working
capital.

